[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0749","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0749.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1025","title":"Unify eWave ServletExec 3.0c 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Unify eWave ServletExec JSP/Java servlet 引擎 3.0C 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。当远程攻击者向目标服务器发送包含 \"/servlet/\" 字符串的特制 URL 时，若 ServletExec servlet 已在运行，该请求会触发异常，导致服务无法正常处理请求。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用此漏洞，攻击条件仅需目标服务器开放网络访问并运行受影响版本的 ServletExec。成功利用将造成服务中断，影响基于该引擎的 Web 应用可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1025"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 ServletExec 到 3.0E 或更高版本，可从 servletexec.com 下载补丁安装。升级前先停止 ServletExec 引擎，安装完成后重启 web 服务器并确认 /servlet/ServletExec 路径不再触发 BindException。临时缓解措施：在 web 服务器层面过滤包含 /servlet/ 的请求路径，限制对 ServletExec 管理接口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97295224226042&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1868","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5435","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20336","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1025.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1025.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1025","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1025.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1025.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1025.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fb434b2032246212419d81952c5a487d58bc8ffa/2000/CVE-2000-1025.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1025.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1025.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1025.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0749.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0749.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0749.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0747","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0747.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1023","title":"Alabanza Control Panel 未授权访问远程修改域漏洞","description":"Alabanza Control Panel 3.0 的 nsManager.cgi CGI 程序存在严重的权限绕过漏洞，该程序在未对用户进行身份认证的情况下允许直接访问管理命令。远程攻击者无需提供用户名和密码，仅需通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求 URL 即可访问域名管理功能，实现对域名注册信息的未授权修改、添加或删除操作。该漏洞影响使用 Alabanza 虚拟主机托管服务的网站及经销商，攻击者可借此篡改 MX 和 CNAME 记录，甚至将恶意域名添加至目标服务器，进而导致服务中断或用于进一步的域名劫持攻击。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1023"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59Z","remediation":"Alabanza 已停止运营且未发布修复补丁，建议立即从服务器中删除或禁用 /cp/rac/nsManager.cgi 脚本，并将域名管理迁移至 BIND、PowerDNS 或云服务商提供的受支持 DNS 管理平台。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Apache 或防火墙层面通过 .htaccess 或 IP 访问控制列表限制 /cp/rac/ 目录的访问权限，仅允许可信管理 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/84766","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1710","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5284","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20238","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1023","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/49d534031f059b5baeabd1b01333339621c7c95a/2000/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1023.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1023.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0747.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0747.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0747.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0746","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0746.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1022","title":"Cisco PIX防火墙 SMTP内容过滤规避漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Cisco Secure PIX 防火墙 5.2(2) 及更早版本中的 mailguard 功能未能正确限制对 SMTP 命令的访问。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在发送受限命令之前先发送 DATA 命令的方式，绕过 SMTP 内容过滤机制，从而执行本应被限制的 SMTP 命令。该漏洞影响 Cisco PIX 防火墙 4.x 和 5.x 系列设备，攻击者无需任何凭证即可远程利用，可能导致邮件内容过滤策略被绕过，进而造成信息泄露或邮件滥用等风险。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1022"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级Cisco PIX Firewall到支持修复的版本（如5.2(3)及以上或4.3(2)及以上），并重新配置邮件网关功能以确保在处理邮件正文之前验证RCpt To命令是否已发送；如无法立即打补丁，可临时通过访问控制列表禁止使用DATA命令 bypassing安全策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0222.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0241.html","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/PIXfirewallSMTPfilter-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1698","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5277","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20231","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1022.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1022","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1022.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1022.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1022.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1022.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/49d534031f059b5baeabd1b01333339621c7c95a/2000/CVE-2000-1022.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1022.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1022.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0746.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0743","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0743.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1021","title":"Alt-N MDaemon WebConfig 远程堆溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Alt-N MDaemon 邮件服务器 3.1.1 及更早版本的 WebConfig 组件中存在堆溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长 URL 的特制 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃、拒绝服务，并可能在特定条件下执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响所有启用 WebConfig 远程管理界面的 MDaemon 实例，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在局域网或互联网范围内发起利用，攻击复杂度低、无需交互即可完成。ExploitDB 已公开相关利用代码，攻击者可据此批量扫描并攻击受影响的邮件服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1021"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MDaemon 至 3.1.2 或更高版本以修复堆溢出漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 WebConfig 服务前部署 WAF 规则限制 URL 长度（如拦截超过 2048 字符的请求），或临时禁用 WebConfig 管理界面对外访问，仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问 1000 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96925269716274&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1689","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5250","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20225","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1021","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f633ee26df31c8f5776009de314413a57041bf98/2000/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1021.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1021.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0743.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0743.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0742","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0742.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1016","title":"SuSE Linux 6.3/6.4 Apache 已安装软件包信息泄露漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.3/6.4 系统中 Apache HTTP 服务器的默认配置文件（httpd.conf）包含了对 /usr/doc 目录的别名映射，导致远程攻击者无需认证即可通过 HTTP 请求访问 /doc/packages URL，读取系统已安装软件包的文档信息，从而获取系统配置信息，为进一步攻击提供情报支持。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1016"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2000-01016\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2000-1016\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"SuSE Linux Apache /usr/doc 目录信息泄露漏洞\"\ndescription = \"SuSE Linux 6.3/6.4 中 Apache 默认配置文件（httpd.conf）为 /usr/doc 目录设置了别名，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过 HTTP 请求 /doc/packages URL 读取已安装软件包的文档和系统配置信息，导致敏感信息泄露，为后续攻击提供情报支撑。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 5.0\nsources = [\"cve\", \"exploitdb\"]\npublished = \"2000-12-11\"\nupdated = \"2000-12-11\"\nremediation = \"编辑 Apache 配置文件 httpd.conf，移除或注释掉 /usr/doc 目录的 Alias 配置项，或使用 <Directory> 指令限制对该目录的访问权限，仅允许本地或授权 IP 访问。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-1016\", \"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20236\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = [\"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20236\"]\nexp_urls = []\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z\"\n\n[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2000-01016\"\nname = \"CVE-2000-1016 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"medium\"\ntags = [\"cve-2000-1016\", \"suze\", \"apache\", \"information-disclosure\"]\ndescription = \"检测 SuSE Linux Apache 是否暴露 /doc/packages 目录，导致已安装软件包信息泄露\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2000-1016\", \"AVE-2000-01016\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/doc/packages/\"\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"Index of\", \"packages\"]\nexpect = true","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/84360","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1707","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5276","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20236","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1016","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81a148a05078ecaf8ff30dafcb6a9851540b3434/2000/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1016.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1016.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0742.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0742.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0742.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0740","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0740.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1014","title":"SCO Unixware 7.0 help HTTP 服务器 search97.cgi 格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SCO Unixware 7 系统中的 SCOhelp HTTP 服务器所包含的 search97.cgi CGI 脚本存在格式化字符串漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 queryText 参数中传入特制的格式化字符串字符（如 %n、%s 等），触发该漏洞，导致攻击者能够在目标服务器上以 Web 服务器进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Unixware 7 全版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1014"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58Z","remediation":"立即禁用 SCOhelp HTTP 服务：以 root 执行 `ps -ef | grep scohelp` 确认进程，然后执行 `/etc/init.d/scohelp stop` 停止服务，并运行 `rm /etc/rc2.d/*scohelp*` 删除开机自启。在防火墙上封锁端口 457/tcp：添加规则 `iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 457 -j DROP`。如业务必须使用，升级至 SCO 官方补丁（联系 SCO 支持获取 Unixware 7 安全补丁包），或将 search97cgi 脚本权限改为 000：`chmod 000 /usr/internet/scohelp/search97cgi/vtopic`。鉴于 Unixware 7 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0325.html","http://www.osvdb.org/3240","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1717","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5291","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20242","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1014","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f15ca12380fc765fd5195387509666c3b113208/2000/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1014.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1014.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0740.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0738","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0738.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1009","title":"Red Hat Linux dump 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 中 dump 工具（版本 0.4b15）存在环境变量信任漏洞。dump 程序信任 RSH 环境变量指定的路径，未对其内容进行任何校验，导致本地攻击者可通过将 RSH 变量修改为指向特洛伊木马程序，当 dump 执行时以 root 权限运行恶意程序，从而获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及使用该版本 dump 的 Linux 发行版，攻击者需拥有本地用户权限即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1009"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 dump 至修补后的版本（如 0.4b16 或更高），该版本不再信任 RSH 环境变量路径。如无法升级，可执行 `chmod u-s /sbin/dump` 移除 dump 的 setuid 权限位，或限制仅 root 用户可执行 dump，以阻断本地提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0438.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1871","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5437","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/193","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1009","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2000/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1009.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1009.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0738.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0736","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0736.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1008","title":"Palm OS 用户密码弱加密漏洞","description":"Palm OS 3.5.2 及更早版本使用弱加密算法存储用户密码，未经身份认证的攻击者在获得目标 Palm 设备的物理访问权限后，可利用此漏洞解密存储的密码，进而非法获取设备的访问权限。该漏洞影响所有运行 Palm OS 3.5.2 及以下版本的掌上设备，攻击者需实际接触设备，通过弱加密逆向破解方式还原用户密码，最终实现对设备的完全控制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1008"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57Z","remediation":"立即升级设备固件至 Palm OS 3.5.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复密码弱加密存储缺陷。若无法升级，请在 Palm 设备的安全设置中关闭密码保护功能，避免密码以明文形式存储于设备本地。同时将设备置于物理安全环境中管控，禁止未经授权的人员接触设备。对于运行 HotSync 网络的场景，建议禁用 HotSync 网络密码同步功能，或在 HotSync Manager 中取消勾选「通过网络发送密码」选项，防止加密密码在网络中明文传输。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a092600-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1715","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20241","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1008.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1008.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1008","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1008.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1008.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1008.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2000/CVE-2000-1008.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1008.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1008.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1008.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0736.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0734","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0734.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1005","title":"eXtropia WebStore 1.0/2.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"eXtropia WebStore 1.0 和 2.0 版本的 html_web_store.cgi 及 web_store.cgi CGI 程序存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 page 参数传递 `../` 序列绕过路径限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 eXtropia WebStore 系列产品，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等）。由于 CGI 程序未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分过滤，攻击者只需构造特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1005"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 eXtropia 官方发布的最新安全版本；如产品已停止维护无法获取补丁，应迁移至其他受支持的购物车系统。临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面配置 mod_rewrite 规则，对 CGI 目录的 page 参数进行路径规范化过滤，限制 `../` 序列的传入，并实施最小权限原则限制 Web 服务器进程对文件系统的访问范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/138495","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5347","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20279","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1005","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2000/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/12065efa5942c8c399e6c39fc2649ac2e94409b9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1005.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1005.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0734.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0732","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0732.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1002","title":"Stalker CommuniGate Pro POP3 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Stalker CommuniGatePro 3.3.2 的 POP3 守护进程在处理用户认证时存在信息泄露漏洞。当用户输入无效用户名和无效密码时，服务器返回不同的错误提示信息，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过枚举用户名的方式，根据错误信息的差异区分出目标服务器上存在的有效邮箱地址。攻击者可利用收集到的有效邮箱地址发起垃圾邮件攻击，导致服务器被滥用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用，影响机密性。厂商已发布更新版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1002"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Stalker CommuniGate Pro 升级至 3.3.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 POP3 服务对不同用户名和密码返回不同错误信息的问题。如无法升级，可在 POP3 服务前端部署反向代理统一错误返回信息，或配置防火墙限制 POP3 端口（110）的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信邮件客户端连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/139523","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1792","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5363","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20175","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1002","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2000/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1002.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1002.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0732.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0731","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0731.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0998","title":"Debian top 程序格式字符串本地提权漏洞","description":"Debian Linux 系统中的 top 程序存在格式字符串漏洞。本地攻击者可以利用该漏洞，通过向 top 程序的 kill 或 renice 函数传递特制格式字符串参数，覆盖内存关键数据或执行任意代码，从而获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响多个 Debian 版本，攻击者需要具备本地访问权限才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0998"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 Debian 系统 procps 包至修复版本，执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install procps` 获取已修补的 top 程序。若暂无法升级，作为临时缓解措施，可通过 `sudo chmod -s /usr/bin/top` 移除 top 的 setuid/setgid 权限，或限制本地用户对 top 的 kill 和 renice 功能访问权限。该漏洞因 top 在 kill/renice 错误处理时将用户输入直接作为格式字符串传递给 printf 导致，修复版本已改用 `printf(\"%s\", errmsg)` 方式安全输出错误消息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1895","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20378","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-0998.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0998.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0998.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-0998.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0998","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0998.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0998.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0998.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0998.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-0998.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0731.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1153","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1153.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1222","title":"IBM AIX sysback 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"AIX 系统自带的 sysback 备份工具（4.2.1.13 之前版本）在运行时会使用相对路径而非绝对路径来查找并执行 hostname 程序。本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量，将路径指向自己构造的恶意 hostname 程序，从而在 sysback 以高权限执行时获得权限提升，实现完全控制目标系统（机密性、完整性、可用性均受影响）。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1222"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24Z","remediation":"升级 AIX sysback 至 4.2.1.13 或更高版本，该版本已修正使用相对路径调用 hostname 的问题。临时缓解措施：在系统 PATH 环境变量中移除当前目录（.）条目，确保 hostname 仅从 /usr/bin 等绝对路径调用，并限制普通用户对 PATH 的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/17566","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6432","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1222.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1222.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1222","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1222.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1222.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1222.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71d64a6d3b3901a67b0e17d4598d8a385b75e78d/2000/CVE-2000-1222.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1222.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1222.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1222.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1153.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0847","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0847.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1224","title":"Caucho Technology Resin JSP 源代码泄漏漏洞","description":"Caucho Technology Resin 1.2 及更早版本存在 JSP 源代码泄漏漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 .jsp 文件请求 URL 后附加特殊字符序列（如 \"..\"、\"%2e..\"、\"%81\"、\"%82\" 等）绕过访问限制，导致服务器返回 JSP 源文件而非执行后的结果。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，成功后可获取 JSP 源码中的敏感信息（如数据库连接凭证、业务逻辑等），危害中等。该漏洞影响 Resin 1.2 及之前版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1224"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-11-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25Z","remediation":"升级至 Caucho Resin 2.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器前置代理层配置规则，拦截包含 `..`、`%2e`、`%81`、`%82` 等特殊字符的 URL 请求，并禁止直接对外暴露 JSP 源码目录的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97502269408279&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/146770","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1986","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5568","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20429","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1224","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963310d0117c8de2c6908e6e4a8dba13966a88f4/2000/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1224.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2000-1224.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0847.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1152","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1152.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1217","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 域账户锁定策略安全绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 2000 SP2 之前版本在非 Windows 2000 域环境中使用 NTLM 认证时，若本地缓存了账户凭据，存在账户锁定策略绕过漏洞。本地用户可通过利用本地缓存的凭据进行无限次登录尝试，绕过系统的账户锁定机制，从而实施暴力破解攻击。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 SP2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1217"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-11-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 发布的 MS00-089 安全更新补丁（下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=45C7A628-CE0E-49D5-B7A7-3A71B2FF4C97），或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 2（SP2）及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可将 Windows 2000 机器加入纯 Windows 2000 域环境（使用 Kerberos 认证替代 NTLM），或在防火墙层面阻止 NetBIOS 端口（137-139、445）以限制远程攻击入口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/818496","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1973","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-089","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5585","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1217.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1217.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1217","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1217.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1217.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2000/CVE-2000-1217.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1217.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1217.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1217.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1217.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1152.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1154","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1154.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1223","title":"Quikstore Shopping Cart 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Quikstore Shopping Cart 的 quikstore.cgi 脚本存在输入验证错误，该脚本采用 Perl 语言编写，用于提供电子商务购物车功能。漏洞产生的原因是代码中使用了不安全的 Perl open() 函数调用形式，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可在 HTTP GET 请求的 URL 部分注入 shell 元字符（如管道符、分号、反引号等），触发 Perl 解释器执行任意系统命令。受影响的包括 Quikstore 2.11.00 之前的所有版本，攻击者可利用该漏洞以 Web 服务器或 CGI 进程的权限执行任意命令，进而完全控制服务器或窃取敏感数据。攻击条件仅需目标服务器运行存在漏洞的 Quikstore 购物车程序并允许外部 HTTP 访问，利用方式为构造包含恶意 shell 元字符的特制 GET 请求 URL。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1223"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-11-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24Z","remediation":"升级 Quikstore Shopping Cart 至 2.11.00 或更高版本，该版本已修复 quikstore.cgi 中的输入验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，应将 Web 服务器进程置于 chroot jail 中运行，并删除 Web 目录中不必要的脚本和可执行文件以限制攻击面；同时通过防火墙限制对 CGI 脚本的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/671444","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1223.json","https: